  "prefLabel": "Bfa 301.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 301.01 Scope. Unless otherwise provided herein, applications which request the authority to take action under the programs established pursuant to RSA 162-A:7, RSA 162-A:8, RSA 162-A:9, RSA 162-A:10, and RSA 162-A:13 shall meet the requirements set forth in Bfa 301.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
